{"asset_key":"ep3/quest_story_13220400","episode":"ep3","category":"quest_story","story_id":"13220400","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:2:1322040001:1":{"text":"데, 데이먼?!","source_cn":"戴、戴蒙？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C3A25AAC9F7E79C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1322040002:1":{"text":"시더 마을로 오다니! 엄마가 허락하신 거야?","source_cn":"你居然来雪松镇了！你妈妈让你出来玩了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2B632D97A72F5856","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1322040003:1":{"text":"전... 음, 전 친구를 만나러 온 거예요...","source_cn":"我……呃，我是来找朋友……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE531824BAF2831E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:5:1322040003":{"text":"전... 음, 전 친구를 만나러 온 거예요...","source_cn":"我……呃，我是来找朋友……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE531824BAF2831E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1322040005:1":{"text":"저... 전 혼자 있고 싶지 않아요...","source_cn":"我……我不想总是一个人……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0D8C4971E0D12E1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1322040006:0":{"text":"게다가